  "content": "<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#fff\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/826577/description_6908ede0-b076-4c43-9004-a486bbe18f52.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"666\" height=\"37\"></span></h1><h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#fff\">📋 <strong>Пройдите все вызовы в Minecraft с помощью <span style=\"color:#b96ad9\">Checkraft</span>!</strong><br>✅ Отслеживайте свой прогресс и делитесь им — <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcheckraft.com%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">Проверьте Checkraft здесь</a></span></h2><p style=\"text-align:center\">![](<a href=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/826577/description_6908ede0-b076-4c43-9004-a486bbe18f52.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/826577/description_6908ede0-b076-4c43-9004-a486bbe18f52.png</a>)</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">![](<a href=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/399025/description_c5e0c8b0-26a1-4906-a2ae-da3f85625ca1.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/399025/description_c5e0c8b0-26a1-4906-a2ae-da3f85625ca1.png</a>)</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">![](<a href=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/826577/description_6908ede0-b076-4c43-9004-a486bbe18f52.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/826577/description_6908ede0-b076-4c43-9004-a486bbe18f52.png</a>)</p><hr><p>| <a href=\"https://discord.gg/mXqZ2WVY8h\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/838/653/ds_buttonlink.png\" alt=\"Присоединяйтесь к нашему Discord\" width=\"193\" height=\"50\"></a> |</p><p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@glythex_mc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/838/654/yt_buttonlink.png\" alt=\"Посмотрите наш канал на YouTube\" width=\"193\" height=\"50\"></a></p><p></p><p><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/yablon_mc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/826577/description_8adcbd14-1f48-412c-98b4-f03dea701632.png\" alt=\"Поддержите меня\"></a></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/826577/description_6908ede0-b076-4c43-9004-a486bbe18f52.png\" alt=\"\"></p><h2 style=\"text-align:center\">📖 **О моде**</h2><p style=\"text-align:center;font-size:18px\">Добро пожаловать в мод «Furnitury», в котором представлено **более 200 уникальных предметов мебели и декора**! Преобразуйте свои постройки в Minecraft с помощью стильной и функциональной мебели — от уютных диванов до современных стульев, добавляя характер и очарование каждой комнате.</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">![](<a href=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/826577/description_6908ede0-b076-4c43-9004-a486bbe18f52.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/826577/description_6908ede0-b076-4c43-9004-a486bbe18f52.png</a>)</p><p style=\"text-align:center;font-size:18px\">![](<a href=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1118/727/furniture_preview_01-png.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1118/727/furniture_preview_01-png.png</a>)</p><p style=\"text-align:center;font-size:18px\">![](<a href=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1118/728/furniture_preview_02-png.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1118/728/furniture_preview_02-png.png</a>)</p><p style=\"text-align:center;font-size:18px\">![](<a href=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1118/729/furniture_preview_03-png.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1118/729/furniture_preview_03-png.png</a>)</p><p style=\"text-align:center;font-size:18px\">![](<a href=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1142/195/coloredpreview-png.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1142/195/coloredpreview-png.png</a>)</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">![](<a href=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/826577/description_6908ede0-b076-4c43-9004-a486bbe18f52.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/826577/description_6908ede0-b076-4c43-9004-a486bbe18f52.png</a>)</p><h2 style=\"text-align:center\">📦 **Другие мои моды**</h2><p>| <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/decostorage\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"width:100px\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/1147/496/638714284727573239.png\" alt=\"Deco Storage\"></a> |<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fishermans-haven\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"width:100px\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/1156/589/638724431391508977.png\" alt=\"Fisherman's Haven\"></a> |<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/safe-harvest\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"width:100px\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/1159/366/638727999635563805.png\" alt=\"Safe Harvest\"></a> |<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/daily-deliveries\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"width:100px\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/1146/888/638713438407165076.png\" alt=\"Daily Deliveries\"></a> |<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dynamites-overhaul\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"width:100px\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1086/957/256/256/638629361784387211.png\" alt=\"Dynamites Overhaul\"></a> |<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/uncraftable-trims-sherds\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"width:100px\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1078/190/256/256/638616623981373274.pn